<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Code expired — <%= companyName %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/honeypot/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="side-panel">
      <div class="side-inner">
        <div class="logo-mark"><%= companyName.charAt(0) %></div>
        <h1><%= companyName %></h1>
        <p>Secure access to internal systems, tools and resources. Use your company credentials to continue.</p>
        <ul class="side-list">
          <li>Single sign-on across internal apps</li>
          <li>Access monitored for your security</li>
          <li>Need help? Contact IT Support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-panel">
      <div class="form-inner">
        <h2>This code has expired</h2>
        <p class="sub">The verification code is no longer valid. Please contact your IT administrator to reset your password, or try signing in again.</p>
        <a href="/" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:8px; padding:10px 16px; background:#2f5fc4; color:#fff; border-radius:5px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">
          Back to sign in
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
